+#   * an epoch must contain a WHOLE number of updates, otherwise the accumulation window
+#     straddles the epoch boundary and its phase drifts by one every epoch (DeepSpeed counts
+#     micro-steps globally, it knows nothing about our epochs);
+#   * OneCycleLR is built on UPDATES (it takes num_updates_per_epoch below), so with
+#     gas>1 it must be given the updates, not the micro-steps, or the cycle ends gas times
+#     too early and the last 3/4 of training runs at final_div_factor lr.
